{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"The nameless sits up, coughing vehemently. His eyes are blurry and his head spinning uncontrollably. He tries to recall what happened to get him here. A murder goose, a deal with someone, and a... Another loss, another thing taken from him. No, not taken. He chose to gave it away. A sense of dreadful regret fills his nameless body, that is until he sees a welcome sight standing near a cart full of stuff. He opens his mouth and lets out a raspy question. \"Seraxa?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T02:57:47.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865426966374383627","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"Luard!\" She immediately embraces him And her head immediately begins to hurt.","created_at":"2021-07-16T02:59:23.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865427369476096032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"<@!366565198284324868>  :game_die:\n**Result**: 1d6 (**1**)\n**Total**: 1","created_at":"2021-07-16T02:59:25.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865427376753606666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"That's not your name anymore, is it?\" She looks at him, carefully.","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:00:02.382000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-16T03:00:07.040000Z","id":"865427531528405013","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"He without a name quickly embraces her back, a warmth feeling his empty self giving him a ghost of a smile. As soon as Seraxa mentions the name however, he hears nothing but a sense of wrongness and dread. His hands droop down to his side and his head bows down to the floor. \"No it isn't.\" All of a sudden, a slight spark of hope and excitement fills his body as his conversation with Gallardia trickles into him. He brings his head back up and flashes his warlock friend a melancholic smirk. \"But what is it ever really?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:03:55.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865428508543942656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"I shouldn't have brought you to the fey,\" she laments, still hugging him tight. \"I should have known better. What else did you have to give up?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:07:34.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865429429035597874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"He hears her sad tone and brings up his hand to awkwardly pat her on the back. \"There, there,\" he doesn't know how to comfort people that much, ain't done it before, \"I'm fine, I'm fine.\" He then grabs Seraxa by the shoulders to push her back for a bit to look her in the eyes. \"You bringing me here was a good thing Seraxa. I am okay with losing parts of 'myself', I don't who that is anymore anyway.\" Bitter laugh. \"But what I am not okay with is leaving you guys,\" he eyes the still sleeping Meorys, \"even that one. I saw what you said to my dead body,\" he brings out the silver wings gift, \"I'm the pilot right captain? I just had to come back.\" He comforts her with a small smile, a smile of genuineness.","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:12:43.830000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865430725271486514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Seraxa smiles, teary. \"Yeah, yeah, you're the pilot.\" She reaches for Meorys' tired hands. \"We have to be careful though. My ravens... they say the redcoats have arrived in Ferrytown. They're destroying the whole city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:14:37.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865431202353774603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Worry instantly fills a nameless face, worry not for himself but for the two here with him. \"Damn them.\" He eyes the cottage around them. \"Do you wanna go somewhere then? The sewers maybe? An airship? Somewhere away from the redcoats? We can carry our friend here out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:17:28.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865431920674340875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"I.... I don't know.... I don't think anywhere is safe.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T03:19:08.618000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865432339190251541","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
