{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Meorys wakes up, exhaustion in her entire body. Her lack frame looks even more bony than it used to. Her features look severe, as if death has aged her. She recalls what happen, lists in her head what she had to give up. *I have to be much much much more careful from now on,* she thinks to herself before looking around the room. \"Hey, Madam Gaillardia. So, I take it my friends were able to bring me back?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:13:21.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865461083049295882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"She nods and looks up from her tea. \"Quite right, dear. Would you care for some tea? You look quite exhausted. Though I understand there's another opportunity for justice in Hampstead, if you think you're up for it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:14:24.755000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865461347570941973","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"I think- yeah, I'd like some tea. Don't think I should be up and about just yet.\" She walks towards where Gaillardia is sitting. \"Is that where my friends are? Hampstead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:17:46.603000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865462194183077898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"She nods and pours you a cup. \"Most. Redcoats came stormin' through here makin' all sorts of a fuss earlier. grabbed up a lot of folks, and now the ones they didn't get who feel able are lookin' to break them out.\" She sighs. \"This wasn't ever their place, and yet they're the ones with all the soliders and whatnot. It gets quite tiring.\" She pauses for a second. \"But i'm putting too much on you, please try and relax. You did die, after all.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:20:55.620000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865462986978492447","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"She sighs a bit, then takes a sip. \"Did anyone else die? Can't imagine what kind of trouble everyone's on after the Redcoats attacked.\" She looks out the window, and stares at the sea. She takes in the smell, and the sound of waves crashing against the cliffside.","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:31:49.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865465728924123147","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"yes, a few others died last night. But from what I hear they're all alive once again. You were even in the cauldron at the same time as two others: Paeton and the nameless.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T05:51:58.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865470799624667176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"Paeton? The nameless? Afraid I don't know these people. I-\", she stammers for a bit, \"I just need to ask, who brought me here? You mentioned something about 'my friends' needing to fulfill something for the deal?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T06:03:54.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865473802250092575","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"Seraxa, Thomas and Apgan. They had to find a few trinkets of significance, which they did. Had they not, we would not be here taking right now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T06:20:38.652000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865478015303155752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"There's a flash of fondness and familiarity at the mention of Seraxa's name. \"Ahh- Sera, I know. I'll have to meet them soon, so I can thank them.\" There's a stretch of silence before she speaks again. \"Can I spend a few minutes outside in your garden? I just... wanna cherish the peace here in your home.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T06:53:41.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865486330611367936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
